{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Steam store page description for a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a pixel art platformer with a lo-fi aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, Y2K-style scene, playing a pogo-stick game in the rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the most \u201cpure\u201d funnly, and let it heal your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players say that this kind of rage game is only played by streamers for their live audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But my original idea for making this game actually came from a few years ago when I was learning how to swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I realized that when you\u2019ve just learned to swim, you have to be completely focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This state of total concentration\u2014born from the fear of choking and the need to maintain balance\u2014is itself a huge source of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this noisy era, focus has become a luxury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s controls are simple. Hold down the spacebar when falling, release it when rising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, but I faced the same dilemma as the creator of Getting Over It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I couldn\u2019t make the controls simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning a new, counterintuitive control scheme is hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty, the satisfaction, and the level design that comes with it\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like it already existed somewhere, like it\u2019s part of the rules of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just happened to discover it and tried to dig it out in its entirety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emerged naturally; it wasn\u2019t something I designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the i am creator, now so\u00a0Skilled with it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if I don\u2019t play with full focus, I still get utterly destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games like this often don\u2019t have much replay value after the first playthrough, except for speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to change that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the excitement of the first playthrough alive when revisiting the game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I added a coin collection mechanic. A fall from too high will make you lose all your coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means if you want to take your coins all the way to the top to double them, you can\u2019t afford a single major mistake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I\u2019ve upgraded this kind of game. I\u2019ve completed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s right there now\u2014this gameplay has been realized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple logic of \u201cthe higher you jump, the higher you bounce\u201d\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy that once only existed in my mind has now been brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That game is out there now, ready to be played!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u4eba\u9020\u592a\u9633","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/72041aeb6fb3a586b9d5c3c3a06812e66214e9bf.jpg"},{"name":"\u81ea\u7531\u661f\u8fb0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/4bf74fc566892a4c6b0fd8d4f0cbdee0b099ef7d.jpg"},{"name":"\u201c\u5927\u4ed6\u8005\u201d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/46a93b74a216048c754fc36a80e59adeaa96a056.jpg"},{"name":"\u201c\u4e0a\u5cb8\u201d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/2c75484ce7c9b58afe90ab6744bcc8308ca17e0d.jpg"},{"name":"\u56de\u5bb6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/26539894b88016663476766523d87ed73ab2a662.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e0a\u5584\u82e5\u6c34","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600940/3df33c9db310778c5bfd86f45dcadc8cc4279f2a.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600940?t=1771770365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/e2b82ec882f0e28411e1e2a7dc2d48d93d3c6053/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771770365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/c4b6b52304e6cf045fc1b343dbd7d91143890e99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771770365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/c4b6b52304e6cf045fc1b343dbd7d91143890e99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771770365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Steam store page description for a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a pixel art platformer with a lo-fi aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/5af119a1ea2ee84774587cd968e4f74c.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, Y2K-style scene, playing a pogo-stick game in the rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the most \u201cpure\u201d funnly, and let it heal your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players say that this kind of rage game is only played by streamers for their live audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But my original idea for making this game actually came from a few years ago when I was learning how to swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I realized that when you\u2019ve just learned to swim, you have to be completely focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This state of total concentration\u2014born from the fear of choking and the need to maintain balance\u2014is itself a huge source of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this noisy era, focus has become a luxury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/48f3e4caf88a5cac6f008f0624eb25fa.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s controls are simple. Hold down the spacebar when falling, release it when rising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, but I faced the same dilemma as the creator of Getting Over It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/93a8e3589c24905d0ea2d16266d53557.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I couldn\u2019t make the controls simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning a new, counterintuitive control scheme is hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty, the satisfaction, and the level design that comes with it\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f6e441d2c82779e4d74f0c2d72fe27c1.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/adba072f6ddb48b85a94df2c87064c64.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like it already existed somewhere, like it\u2019s part of the rules of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just happened to discover it and tried to dig it out in its entirety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emerged naturally; it wasn\u2019t something I designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the i am creator, now so\u00a0Skilled with it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if I don\u2019t play with full focus, I still get utterly destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/d1faba6aa739214db14644c5d6f0ec36.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/20e715a90b653f5dfbffdae341fda09d.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games like this often don\u2019t have much replay value after the first playthrough, except for speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to change that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the excitement of the first playthrough alive when revisiting the game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e743e0b0d94ae22e70e95a163cadda03.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I added a coin collection mechanic. A fall from too high will make you lose all your coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/1fea3dadd524477c516c6c73c7f2bb26.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means if you want to take your coins all the way to the top to double them, you can\u2019t afford a single major mistake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.poster.avif?t=1771770365\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.webm?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/49e7dc719bb1e666a38840ba5292acf6.mp4?t=1771770365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I\u2019ve upgraded this kind of game. I\u2019ve completed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s right there now\u2014this gameplay has been realized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple logic of \u201cthe higher you jump, the higher you bounce\u201d\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy that once only existed in my mind has now been brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That game is out there now, ready to be played!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["liangzixiaoqiang"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/d550206845b370ff24ad50eef028afb105dbe3e3/header.jpg?t=1771770365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},